# Sky whale body plan — "sleek": the juvenile racer of the pod. Preview
# it without booting the game:
#
#   godot --headless --path . --script tools/ship_preview.gd -- ships/whale_sleek.ship
#
# A candidate body plan beside ships/whale.ship (the bulky adult sperm
# whale). Same rules, different proportions: long and low, 28 wide by 3
# tall, never more than 3 rows thick anywhere. The ventral line runs
# straight; the dorsal line lifts once, over the shoulders, and drops
# again into a short blunt snout — a torpedo with a tail. Thin at the
# stock (1 row) so the small fluke reads as a kick, not a paddle.
#
# Blunt head to the RIGHT, tapering tail to a fluke LEFT. The two empty
# cells inside the shoulders are the STOMACH cavity (swallowed loot
# rides there — mine in and you break through into a hollow). A juvenile
# is nearly all blubber: the meat core is a thin seam through the
# shoulders, the only place the body is deep enough to have an inside.
# (Post-jam adjustment 2026-08-20: shoulder widened 2 columns and the
# seam thickened so composition sits inside the surveyed 50-85%
# blubber band — the suite gates every pod member on it.)
#
#   W  blubber (buoyant flesh — keep it the majority or the whale falls)
#   M  meat (dense core)
#
# One connected piece. Keep it that way.

origin 14 1

W.............WWWWWWWWWWWW..
WWWWWWWWWWWWWWMMMMMMMM..MMWW
W...WWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWWW
